。\nざっくりとした内容になってしまいましたが、どうぞよろしくお願いいたします。", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@kou_baa/works/33", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 269249, "client_id": 729212, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b54daa99/uploads/origins/35cafa7b-005d-46d9-a6ac-f56cebcf3986?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f541ec70c43ea7a4030d4c7d4aca67dd", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b54daa99/uploads/origins/35cafa7b-005d-46d9-a6ac-f56cebcf3986?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=fc139ea595677e526a7395c92df7b257", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hello!\nYour angel is awesome! This one:\nhttps://x.com/kou_baa/status/1725554842863837384\n\nPlease draw angel Mawy. As small Mawy. In angel attire, wings and supercute feeling about her.\n\nShe is sometimes mean, smug and sneaky but ultimately aspiring to be an angel with her actions bringing great good to others. Here are her references:\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/witch-mary-collection-HUVbBIg\n\nこんにちは！\nあなたの天使は素晴らしいです！これは：\nhttps://x.com/kou_baa/status/1725554842863837384\n\n天使のマウィを描いてください。小さなマウィとして。天使の衣装、羽、そして彼女の超かわいい感じ。\n\n彼女は時々意地悪で、うぬぼれが強く、卑劣ですが、最終的には天使になることを目指しており、彼女の行動は他の人に大きな利益をもたらします。彼女の参考資料は次のとおりです：\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/witch-mary-collection-HUVbBIg\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/witch-mary-collection-HUVbBIg", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@kou_baa/works/32", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 269249, "client_id": 132054, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b933a0b2/uploads/origins/79a0d0b9-1ead-4b85-8f8c-902c076c1a8f?bg=%23fff&auto=form